{"n":6,"title":"How are you? — the honest answer","blurb":"Говорить, как вы себя чувствуете","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"How are you? — the honest answer","sub":"","html":"<p>Чувства не только «fine, thanks» — и простая вежливость.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Говорить, как вы себя чувствуете</li><li>Спрашивать, как дела</li><li>Естественно отвечать «да/нет»</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Как вы сегодня? Выберите.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"good"},{"label":"tired"},{"label":"busy"},{"label":"cold"},{"label":"happy"},{"label":"so-so"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"How are you?","pos":"","ru":"Как дела?","kk":"Қалыңыз қалай?","def":"Hi! How are you?","img":"/course/a0/img/l6-how-are-you.jpg","audio":"/course/a0/audio/19b2535a4c24.mp3"},{"en":"Fine, thanks.","pos":"","ru":"Хорошо, спасибо.","kk":"Жақсы, рахмет.","def":"— How are you? — Fine, thanks.","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"Great.","pos":"","ru":"Отлично.","kk":"Тамаша.","def":"Great, thanks. And you?","img":null,"audio":null},{"en":"OK.","pos":"","ru":"Нормально.","kk":"Жақсы.","def":"I'm OK, thanks.","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— How are you?","options":["I'm from Turkey.","Fine, thanks. And you?","Nice to meet you."],"keep":false,"answer":"Fine, thanks. And you?","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Fine, thanks. And you?","options":["Great, thanks.","Yes, I am.","My name is Ray."],"keep":false,"answer":"Great, thanks.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"happy","pos":"","ru":"счастливый","kk":"бақытты","def":"I'm happy today.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/3978d009748e.mp3"},{"en":"sad","pos":"","ru":"грустный","kk":"көңілсіз","def":"She's sad.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/b4914600112b.mp3"},{"en":"tired","pos":"","ru":"уставший","kk":"шаршаған","def":"I'm tired.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/511e99115957.mp3"},{"en":"busy","pos":"","ru":"занятой","kk":"бос емес","def":"He's busy at work.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/e18a89f9cc5b.mp3"},{"en":"bored","pos":"","ru":"скучающий","kk":"зеріккен","def":"They're bored.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/aa6897a9085e.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"match","title":"Соедините слово и перевод.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"happy","right":"счастливый"},{"left":"sad","right":"грустный"},{"left":"tired","right":"уставший"},{"left":"busy","right":"занятой"},{"left":"bored","right":"скучающий"}],"options":["грустный","занятой","счастливый","скучающий","уставший"]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"cold","pos":"","ru":"холодно","kk":"суық","def":"I'm cold today.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/424fa43965bd.mp3"},{"en":"hot","pos":"","ru":"жарко","kk":"ыстық","def":"My coffee is hot.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/4bd8eddacb60.mp3"},{"en":"thirsty","pos":"","ru":"хочу пить","kk":"шөлдеген","def":"I'm thirsty. Water, please.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/31a02cf93839.mp3"},{"en":"ill","pos":"","ru":"больной","kk":"ауру","def":"He isn't at work. He's ill.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/e233f084399e.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I'm","after":". Water, please.","answers":["thirsty"],"bank":["hot","tired","thirsty"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She isn't at work. She's","after":".","answers":["ill"],"bank":["busy","great","ill"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Close the door! I'm","after":".","answers":["cold"],"bank":["happy","hot","cold"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"По-английски вы «есть» уставший, а не «имеете» усталость.","items":[{"text":"I'm tired.","src":null},{"text":"She isn't busy.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"to be + прилагательное","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Лицо</th><th>Утверждение</th><th>Отрицание</th></tr><tr><td>I</td><td>I'm happy.</td><td>I'm not happy.</td></tr><tr><td>He</td><td>He's ill.</td><td>He isn't ill.</td></tr><tr><td>She</td><td>She's busy.</td><td>She isn't busy.</td></tr><tr><td>We</td><td>We're cold.</td><td>We aren't cold.</td></tr><tr><td>They</td><td>They're bored.</td><td>They aren't bored.</td></tr></table><p>Слово-состояние идёт после <b>am / is / are</b>.</p><p>Прилагательное не меняется: they're <b>tired</b>, а не «tireds».</p><p>Для «нет» — <b>not</b>: isn't, aren't, I'm not.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Короткие ответы","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th>Вопрос</th><th>Да</th><th>Нет</th></tr><tr><td>Are you tired?</td><td>Yes, I am.</td><td>No, I'm not.</td></tr><tr><td>Is he a student?</td><td>Yes, he is.</td><td>No, he isn't.</td></tr><tr><td>Are they doctors?</td><td>Yes, they are.</td><td>No, they aren't.</td></tr></table><p>Отвечайте тем же глаголом: Are you…? → Yes, I <b>am</b>.</p><p>«Yes, I am.» — полный ответ, больше слов не нужно.</p><p>Нельзя сказать «Yes, I'm.» — краткой формой ответ не заканчивают.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["How are you?","I'm fine, thanks.","Are you tired?","Yes, I am.","Is she busy?","No, she isn't."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"I ___ tired.","options":["is","am","are"],"keep":false,"answer":"am","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"He ___ busy today.","options":["are","am","is"],"keep":false,"answer":"is","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["They","bored.","not","are"],"answer":"They are not bored.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Are you thirsty?","options":["Yes, I'm.","Yes, I am.","Yes, I do."],"keep":false,"answer":"Yes, I am.","why":"Краткий ответ не заканчивается на I'm.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"— Is she ill?","options":["No, she isn't.","No, she doesn't.","No, she not."],"keep":false,"answer":"No, she isn't.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"— Are they students? — Yes, they","after":".","answers":["are"],"bank":["are","do","is"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"— Is he ill? — No, he","after":".","answers":["isn't"],"bank":["aren't","am not","isn't"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"Да или нет?","sub":"","columns":["Да","Нет"],"items":[{"text":"No, we aren't.","col":1},{"text":"No, she isn't.","col":1},{"text":"Yes, they are.","col":0},{"text":"No, I'm not.","col":1},{"text":"Yes, I am.","col":0},{"text":"Yes, he is.","col":0}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"— Are you happy? — Yes, I","after":".","answers":["am"],"bank":["do","is","am"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"We","after":"cold. We're OK.","answers":["aren't"],"bank":["am not","isn't","aren't"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["today?","you","Are","tired"],"answer":"Are you tired today?","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["She","busy.","not","is"],"answer":"She is not busy.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["thirsty.","am","I"],"answer":"I am thirsty.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","have","cold","today."],"bad":1,"answer":"I am cold today.","why":"По-английски «I am cold», а не «I have cold»."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["Yes,","I'm."],"bad":1,"answer":"Yes, I am.","why":"В кратком ответе — полная форма: I am."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["They","are","tireds."],"bad":2,"answer":"They are tired.","why":"К прилагательному -s не добавляется."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/19b2535a4c24.mp3","prompt":"Первый ответ:","options":["Great, thanks.","Fine, thanks. And you?","I'm tired."],"answer":"Fine, thanks. And you?","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/19b2535a4c24.mp3","prompt":"Второй ответ:","options":["Great, thanks.","Fine, thanks.","Not bad."],"answer":"Great, thanks.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Это вопрос?","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/9517706ab60a.mp3","prompt":"","options":["Yes — it goes up at the end.","No — it goes down at the end."],"answer":"Yes — it goes up at the end.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/6426e0490853.mp3","before":"You're here","after":"holiday.","answers":["on"],"bank":["on","in","at"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Это вопрос?","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/d94f12ae3c23.mp3","prompt":"","options":["No — it goes down at the end.","Yes — it goes up at the end."],"answer":"Yes — it goes up at the end.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/e38148f19bb2.mp3","prompt":"Фернандо студент?","options":["Yes, he is.","No, he isn't.","We don't know."],"answer":"No, he isn't.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/04dc1e1d3b15.mp3","before":"— Are they doctors? — No, they","after":".","answers":["aren't"],"bank":["aren't","isn't","don't"]},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/3fb686490415.mp3","prompt":"— Thanks very much.","options":["You're welcome.","I'm fine.","Sorry."],"answer":"You're welcome.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/9d17ec9898fe.mp3","prompt":"В чём дело?","options":["He is ill.","He is late.","He is tired."],"answer":"He is late.","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Рэя.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ray</p><p>Hi! I'm Ray. It's Monday morning.</p><p>I'm tired and I'm cold.</p><p>My coffee is hot. Now I'm OK!</p><p>My sister is happy today — she isn't busy.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Ray is tired.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ray</p><p>Hi! I'm Ray. It's Monday morning.</p><p>I'm tired and I'm cold.</p><p>My coffee is hot. Now I'm OK!</p><p>My sister is happy today — she isn't busy.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"His sister is busy.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ray</p><p>Hi! I'm Ray. It's Monday morning.</p><p>I'm tired and I'm cold.</p><p>My coffee is hot. Now I'm OK!</p><p>My sister is happy today — she isn't busy.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Как Рэй после кофе?","options":["He's sad.","He's ill.","He's OK."],"keep":false,"answer":"He's OK.","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Ray</p><p>Hi! I'm Ray. It's Monday morning.</p><p>I'm tired and I'm cold.</p><p>My coffee is hot. Now I'm OK!</p><p>My sister is happy today — she isn't busy.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Напишите про сегодня.","sub":"Одно — какой вы есть, другое — какой не есть.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>Today I'm ___ .</li><li>I'm not ___ .</li><li>My friend is ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">happy</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">tired</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">busy</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">cold</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">hot</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">thirsty</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">bored</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I'm</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I'm not</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>В предложении 1 есть <b>I'm</b> + состояние.</li><li>В предложении 2 есть <b>not</b>.</li><li>У слов-состояний нет <b>-s</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"В вопросе интонация идёт вверх.","items":["How are you?","Fine, thanks. And you?","Are you tired?","Yes, I am."]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 6 пройден","sub":"Урок 6 из 24 · Юнит 2","items":["Я могу сказать, как себя чувствую.","Я могу спросить, как дела.","Я могу ответить Yes, I am. / No, I'm not."]}]}
